        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "1c4d299b-27b3-50dc-b86a-ed09cf600496",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Huai'an, Qian'an, Qing Yan Garden, Qinglong Manchu Autonomous County\n- Regions: Jiangsu, Hebei, Eastern China, North China, Liaoning, Qinhuangdao\n\nFacts:\n- Huai'an was formerly called Huaiyin until 2001.\n- Huai'an is a prefecture-level city in central Jiangsu province in Eastern China.\n- Qian'an is a city in the northeastern part of Hebei province in North China.\n- Qing Yan Garden is located in Huai'an City, Jiangsu Province, China.\n- Qinglong Manchu Autonomous County borders Lingyuan and Jianchang County in Liaoning to the north.\n- Qinglong Manchu Autonomous County borders Suizhong County in Liaoning and Qinhuangdao city proper to the east.\n- Qinglong Manchu Autonomous County borders Qian'an and Lulong County to the south.\n- Qinglong Manchu Autonomous County borders Kuancheng Manchu Autonomous County and Qianxi County to the west.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "a272c993-e402-5bc2-86b4-58a5c1bdc54a",
